              ],
              "path": [
                "data",
                "b2b",
                "v1",
                "job"
              ]
            },
            "description": "# Overview\nCreate and run asynchronous bulk jobs to retrieve company or contact data using entity IDs or search filters. This API is ideal for large data exports with a file-based CSV output.\n\nYou can submit up to **10,000 entity IDs** in a single request. The API initiates an asynchronous job and returns a `jobId` to track its status and retrieve results using the Job Status API."
          },
